Subject: Project Kickoff - Customer Support Portal

Hi Team,

We are officially starting the Customer Support Portal project.

The primary objective is to reduce customer response time by allowing customers to create support tickets online instead of relying on phone calls.

Key business requirements discussed:

- Customers should be able to register and log in.
- Customers should be able to create support tickets.
- Customers should receive email notifications whenever a ticket status changes.
- Support agents should be able to assign and update tickets.

Let's finalize the requirements document before July 20.

